      "text": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>Mega Skarmory is a challenging raid due to its increased attack stat and access to several high damaging moves e.g: Brave Bird. Various Megas can be used depending on its moveset. </p><h4>Est Time to Win: 270.0s - 290.0s</h4><p><br></p><h2>Main Strategy</h2><p>Simply DPS with Shadow Reshiram and opt to <a href=\"https://soloraidarchive.github.io/solo-raid-mechanics.html#strategy-catch-tank\" target=\"_blank\">catch tank</a> the high damaging brave bird with either Regieleki or another Shadow Reshiram. Mega Raichu Y or Mega Delphox are ideal DPS positive to use in the main DPS slot. There are certain caveats. </p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>It is recommended to have Mega Raichu Y at level 51.5 or higher. This is because it gets a fast move breakpoint with thundershock given 15 attack. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>It is recommended to run Mega Delphox if Mega Raichu Y is not available.</li></ol><p><br></p><p>Blacephalon can be used although due to the high damaging charge moves, it must use with extra caution. Especially against the lethal brave bird. </p>",
